Package: jarticr
Type: Package
Title: Read Japanese Road Traffic Volume Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Shinya", family = "Uryu", email = "suika1127@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cph", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-0493-6186"))
    )
Description: Reads two distinct Japanese road traffic volume sources and
    returns them as tidy tables. It reads cross-sectional traffic volume files
    ("type B" open data) published by the Japan Road Traffic Information Center
    (JARTIC, <https://www.jartic.or.jp>), handling changes in their CSV layout
    and encoding. It also builds requests for, retrieves, and parses GeoJSON or
    JSON-encoded CSV from the xROAD traffic-volume API operated by the Ministry
    of Land, Infrastructure, Transport and Tourism.
